  "guidance": "Synthetic Connectathon context only: community residence and exclusion of hospice, inpatient and long-term-care settings are supplied by the track context; AMB does not prove residence or hospice status. Age is calculated at the linked encounter start. A completed screen requires status completed and one usable Boolean answer for each required linkId in one response. Explicit false is complete; absent or incomplete responses do not enter the numerator. The measure counts a patient once when any linked eligible encounter has a completed screen within the period.",
